{"name":"Deep Space","hex":"#3f4143","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deep space","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or in the area of space beyond the gravitational influence of Earth, or outside the Solar System."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["All of space beyond the gravitational influence of Earth, or outside the Solar System, or distant from stars."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deep_space"}],"entries":[{"title":"Goldstone Deep Space Communications Complex","blocks":[{"text":"The Goldstone Deep Space Communications Complex (GDSCC), commonly called the Goldstone Observatory, is a satellite ground station located in Fort Irwin in the U.S. state of California. Operated by NASA's Jet Propulsion Laboratory (JPL), its main purpose is to track and communicate with interplanetary space missions. It is named after Goldstone, California, a nearby gold-mining ghost town."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Goldstone_Deep_Space_Communication_Complex_-_GPN-2000-000506.jpg/330px-Goldstone_Deep_Space_Communication_Complex_-_GPN-2000-000506.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldstone_Deep_Space_Communications_Complex"},{"title":"Deep Space (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Deep Space is a 1988 sci-fi horror film directed by Fred Olen Ray, starring Charles Napier, Ann Turkel and Bo Svenson. Napier stars as a cop trying to stop the murderous rampage of an escaped creature engineered by the government."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/18/Deep_Space_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deep_Space_(film)"},{"title":"Space","blocks":[{"text":"Space is a three-dimensional continuum containing positions and directions. In classical physics, physical space is often conceived in three linear dimensions. Modern physicists usually consider it, with time, to be part of a boundless four-dimensional continuum known as spacetime. The concept of space is considered to be of fundamental importance to an understanding of the physical universe. However, disagreement continues between philosophers over whether it is itself an entity, a relationship between entities, or part of a conceptual framework."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/3D_coordinate_system.svg/330px-3D_coordinate_system.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Photo_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg/500px-Photo_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Photo_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg/1280px-Photo_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Photo_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg/500px-Photo_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Goldstone Observatory in 1963","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhoto_Goldstone_Observatory_1963_-_Touring_Club_Italiano_07_0239.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/PioneerDeepSpaceStation.jpg/500px-PioneerDeepSpaceStation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/PioneerDeepSpaceStation.jpg/500px-PioneerDeepSpaceStation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_camp